# Doxyfile for ProjectV
#
# Generated `2026-06-19` as part of comment-minimization-r0 plan (see
# agent/status.md §44 + agent/active-sessions.md
# session-2026-06-19T-comment-minimization-r0).
#
# Per operator decision (Q4): docs/api/ HTML is NOT committed to git;
# only this Doxyfile + docs/api/.gitkeep + docs/api/README.md land in
# the repository. To regenerate HTML locally:
#
#     doxygen Doxyfile
#     xdg-open docs/api/html/index.html      # Linux
#     start docs/api/html/index.html        # Windows
#
# Doxygen 1.16.x is installed on Linux (per `which doxygen`) and on
# the Windows host where the operator runs the build.

